        "content": "## Analytics & learning loop\nDaily: per-post metrics from Upload-Post (`GET /api/uploadposts/post-analytics/{request_id}`)\nfor posts 1-8 days old → **Metrics**. Weekly (INSIGHTS_WEEKDAY, 1 = Monday): the AI reads Log + Metrics + Clicks + Sales\nand writes **Insights**, which the autopilot's brief reads before writing the next posts.",
